[b]v1.1.1 — Fair kills and combat knockouts[/b]
[list]
[*]A victim that dies while still down (e.g. you butcher a knocked-out animal for hide/meat) now counts for [b]whoever knocked it down[/b], not the looter. If a creature or NPC outside your squad downed it, it doesn't count for you. Thanks to az455862 for the report!
[*][b]Knockouts in regular fights now count[/b]. Before, only stealth knockouts were detected.
[/list]
Existing progress is kept. Requires RE_Kenshi v0.3.5+. Full changelog: [url=https://github.com/LucasSKrewer/kenshi-achievements/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md]GitHub[/url]
